PRX Voice virtual microphone driver
===================================

PrxVoiceMicrophoneDriver.c is adapted from HexMicrophoneDriver.c of the Hex
project (https://github.com/anomalyco/hex), which is distributed under the MIT
licence. The source file carries "SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT, Copyright (c)
2026 Kit Langton"; the repository LICENSE file of Hex names the copyright holder
as "Christopher Langton". Both notices are preserved here.

Changes made for PRX Voice: identifiers renamed from Hex to Prx, device names,
device and box UIDs, manufacturer string, bundle identifier and factory UUID
replaced; the transport type reported by the devices is a build-time option
(PRX_TRANSPORT_TYPE). The driver logic is otherwise unchanged.

